    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the chemical oxygen generator, its cradle, the mask hose set and the firing actuator inside a passenger service unit, with the twelve and twenty-two minute generator items.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "To identify the chemical oxygen generator, its retaining hardware, the mask hose set and the firing actuator inside a passenger service unit.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn with the passenger service unit panel dropped and the mask stowage removed. Item 10 and item 10A are the twenty-two minute and twelve minute generators; the part numbers differ only in the modification suffix on the label and the effectivity note must be read before ordering, because a mixed installation within one service unit is prohibited. The hose kit at item 20 is matched to the generator and must be ordered with it. The outboard hose at item 30 is fitted only at every second row where the run is longest, and the row list is on sheet 2."
    },
